{"divisionName":"Tampa","divisionExternalId":"8300","id":280,"name":"Lagoon Residences at Epperson","divisionId":37,"createdAt":"2024-03-12T12:58:41.654Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-18T16:24:54.332Z","createdBy":48,"updatedBy":184,"lastIP":null,"deletedAt":null,"deletedBy":null,"communityAvailabilityRefId":221,"useDefaultLeadsRecipients":true,"leadsRecipientOverride":"","entityAddressId":31386,"useOffsiteSalesCenter":false,"offsiteSalesCenterEntityAddressId":null,"salesOfficeEmail":"tampainfo@drbgroup.com","salesOfficeHours":"Monday-Thursday & Saturday 10am-6pm | Friday & Sunday 12pm-6pm","salesOfficePhone":"8132520074","salesOfficePhoneExtension":null,"schoolDistrictId":null,"marketingHeadline":"The Only Gated 2-Car Garage Luxury Townhomes Backing to Epperson Lagoon – Lives Like a Single-Family Home","marketingDescription":"<p data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"677\"><strong data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"240\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Lagoon Residences at Epperson</span></strong> is an exclusive collection of modern luxury townhomes in Wesley Chapel, FL - located within a private gated enclave in the award-winning <a href=\"https://metrodevelopmentgroup.com/communities/epperson/?utm_term=&amp;utm_campaign=Seaire+-+PMax&amp;utm_source=adwords&amp;utm_medium=ppc&amp;hsa_acc=3152541150&amp;hsa_cam=21009481129&amp;hsa_grp=&amp;hsa_ad=&amp;hsa_src=x&amp;hsa_tgt=&amp;hsa_kw=&amp;hsa_mt=&amp;hsa_net=adwords&amp;hsa_ver=3&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=22089453529&amp;gbraid=0AAAAApkMUo-f0085-A2t0A_iBlIp3z1Ju&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjwyMnNBhBNEiwA-Kcgu77BbFH8KrA-2QjgmwCLpFfhGmPee-Vwhnd2_V3_xSI4ExzqV6jZjRoCmrkQAvD_BwE\"><strong data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"396\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Epperson</span></strong></a> community. Designed for effortless living, these sophisticated residences blend modern finishes, spacious layouts, and a low-maintenance lifestyle.</p>\n<p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"1197\">Located in the heart of <a href=\"https://wesleychapelcommunity.com/\"><strong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"777\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Wesley Chapel</span></strong></a>, Lagoon Residences at Epperson offers convenient access to the Tampa Bay region, including nearby shopping, dining, healthcare, and major commuter routes. Residents enjoy close proximity to <a href=\"https://www.theshopsatwiregrass.com/\"><strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"994\">The Shops at Wiregrass</strong></a> and <a href=\"https://www.premiumoutlets.com/outlet/tampa\"><strong data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1024\">Tampa Premium Outlets</strong></a>, along with easy connectivity to <strong data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1099\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Tampa</span></strong> for work and entertainment. <a href=\"https://www.drbhomes.com/drbhomes/find-your-home/communities/florida/tampa/lagoon-residences-at-epperson/area-map\">The location</a> balances suburban comfort with metropolitan convenience.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1360\">Each townhome at Lagoon Residences at Epperson features <a href=\"https://www.drbhomestampadesignstudio.com/\">thoughtfully designed layouts</a> that combine style and functionality, including:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1635\">\n<li data-section-id=\"jahw7i\" data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1406\"><p data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1406\">Spacious multi-level townhome floorplans</p></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"16ca8gy\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1459\"><p data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1459\">Open-concept living areas ideal for entertaining</p></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1yhotss\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1515\"><p data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1515\">Designer-selected finishes and details</p></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"kx7rak\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1635\"><p data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1635\">Low-maintenance living designed for convenience</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1752\">These homes offer the comfort and space of a single-family residence with the simplicity of luxury townhome living.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1axx31l\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1788\">Exceptional Community Amenities</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"2142\"><a href=\"https://www.fox13news.com/video/fmc-y5kfo3acgzo0a4tk\">Epperson</a> is a thoughtfully designed community where nature and recreation thrive. Residents can unwind at the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.metrolagoons.com/epperson-lagoon-wesley-chapel?utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_campaign=business-listing\"><strong>Epperson Lagoon</strong></a>, with its turquoise waters, sandy beaches, and year-round activities. The <strong>Eagle Park and Lake House</strong>&nbsp;offers a scenic spot for gatherings, while the&nbsp;<strong>Butterfly Park and Garden</strong>&nbsp;invites tranquility and connection with nature. Pet owners will love the&nbsp;<strong>dog park</strong>, and the&nbsp;<strong>trails</strong> provide perfect pathways for exploration. Together, these amenities create a vibrant lifestyle for all to enjoy.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1it2d6u\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2175\">Discover Lagoon Living Today</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2419\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">New homes in Wesley Chapel, FL are now selling at&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2243\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Lagoon Residences at Epperson</span></strong>. <a href=\"https://www.drbhomes.com/drbhomes/find-your-home/communities/florida/tampa/lagoon-residences-at-epperson/overview?showform=request-appointment\">Schedule your visit</a> to explore available floorplans, tour the community, and experience lagoon living in one of the Tampa Bay area&rsquo;s most unique and sought-after communities.</p>","marketingVideoTourUrl":null,"marketingVirtualTourUrl":null,"brand":"drbhomes","externalId":null,"marketingName":null,"sitePlanImage":null,"openingDate":null,"status":"active","unSubmittedForms":[],"marketingDisplayPromotion":